OL,3,AShops looted as German cost-of-living
OL,4,Aprotests turn violent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands joined largely peaceful
OL,7,Fdemonstrations earlier in the day. They
OL,8,Fwere organised by the campaign group
OL,9,FGen Z regelt - meaning "Gen Z takes
OL,10,Fcharge" - to protest against
OL,11,Funderfunding in schools, the high cost
OL,12,Fof living, public spending cuts and
OL,13,Fmilitary service.
OL,15,FThe unrest in Germany follows similar
OL,16,Fyouth-led mass protests in France,
OL,17,Fwhere more than 320,000 people also
OL,18,Fdemonstrated on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
